I don't know if you can all get Jaffa Cakes where you are, if not.....you are missing out!
I love Jaffa Cakes and really fancied trying this make. The result is so good, it's gone on "my list". 

What you'll need to make this ice cream yourself:

Ice Cream:
450g milk
300g cream at 49% fat
70g sugar
35g dextrose
40g SMP
20g cocoa powder 21% (used Callebaut here)
30g milk chocolate 
2g stabilizer 


Chocolate Orange Fudge Swirl:
50g sugar
50g milk chocolate
15g cocoa
50g milk
15g corn syrup 
7g coconut oil 
5g orange extract 

Chocolate Ganache:
50g Milk Chocolate 
5g Coconut Oil 

The fudge tastes IDENTICAL to Jaffa Cakes if you use Nielsen Massey Orange extract to I recommend you find that specifically. 

